  "cues": [
   [
    0.104,
    "Chapter nine, lesson eight."
   ],
   [
    2.109,
    "Fermentation and anaerobic respiration."
   ],
   [
    5.0,
    "A lump of dough sits in a warm bowl, and slowly it swells into a loaf."
   ],
   [
    10.117,
    "Inside it are yeast cells, and the bubbles that puff it up are a clue about what they are doing."
   ],
   [
    15.247,
    "Here is our respiration map once more."
   ],
   [
    17.891,
    "Most of it needs oxygen."
   ],
   [
    19.557,
    "But look at glycolysis, in the cytosol."
   ],
   [
    22.37,
    "It does not need oxygen at all, and today the mitochondrion is crossed out."
   ],
   [
    27.083,
    "What can a cell do when the oxygen runs out?"
   ]
  ]
